# The generated contract is compared byte-for-byte in CI (`git diff --exit-code` after
# regenerating). This repo is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, so without pinning
# these to LF a commit could carry CRLF into the repo and fail that check on Linux for a reason
# that has nothing to do with the schema.
packages/schema/src/generated/*.ts text eol=lf
packages/schema/schemas/*.json      text eol=lf
